            <div class="slp-hero-copy reveal-item">
                <p class="slp-eyebrow">Enterprise Storage Operations Platform</p>
                <h1 class="slp-title">Stop Monitoring Storage Problems. Start Fixing Them.</h1>
                <p class="slp-subtitle">
                    StorageLens gives IT and operations teams deep storage visibility, intelligent automation,
                    and audit-ready reporting in one modern platform.
                </p>
                <div class="slp-cta-row">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-gradient btn-lg" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#requestDemoModal">Request a Demo</button>
